  How to write a project-specific rule.

  Copy this file to `<name>.md` (drop the .template suffix), then register it in
  the "Rules index" table of ../../AGENTS.md. Agents read a rule when a file
  matching its `paths` glob is touched — so keep each rule scoped and small.

  Golden rule: DON'T restate lailai.skill here. The general voice/wording/math/
  code/design rules already live in `.agents/skills/lailai-skill/`. A project
  rule holds only the slice that's specific to THIS repo, and points to the
  skill for the rest — the way the site's rules/writing-style.md does.

  Delete this comment block in the real file.
-->

